[Findings] ============================================================
[Findings] CORPUS COVERAGE GAP
[Findings] ============================================================

  Recall@1000 — v2 (20M): 0.698   MiniLM (98K): 0.794
  Gap: -9.6 pp — companies v2 finds on 20M that our 98K corpus cannot contain.
  This is a CORPUS COVERAGE gap, not a MODEL QUALITY gap.
  MiniLM's embedding approach is sound — the 98K subsample is the bottleneck.

